# Firm-level microdata artifact: NOT committed to the (public) repo. The app
# fetches it at startup from WBES_PROCESSED_URL (e.g. Firebase Storage) and falls
# back to this local file in development. The small AGGREGATE artifacts in
# data/processed/ (latest, country_panel, regional, meta.rds, wb_macro.rds, ...)
# ARE committed and are safe to publish.
